  "prefLabel": "Cul-H 102.47 Unmarked human burial",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Cul-H 102.47 “Unmarked human burial” means “unmarked human burial” as defined in RSA 227-C1, X, namely “any interment of human remains for which there exists no grave marker or any other historical documentation providing information as to the identity of the deceased.”\n\nSource. #10217, eff 10-30-12, EXPIRED: 7-1-18\n\nStatutory Authority: RSA 227-C:5; 16 USC 470",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/cul-h100.html"
